{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"changes to its own directory.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427196186}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"\n\nThe startup script","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427198466}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" will resolve its own","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427198511}
