{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" with CLI flags pointing","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427201300}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" to a relative data ","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427201396}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"directory. This avoids","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427201461}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" hard-coding an absolute","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427201491}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" path that could write","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427201541}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" outside the worktree.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427201588}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"\n\nWriting the health","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203501}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" handler module now.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203548}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" It exports a JSON response","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203593}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" builder and a helper","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203640}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" that sends a 200 status","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203695}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" with explicit Content-Length","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203695}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" headers. The main server","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203733}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" file will parse NODE_ID","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203777}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" and PORT from environment","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203830}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" variables.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427203876}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"\n\nThe server validates","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427205947}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" NODE_ID as an integer","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427206032}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" of 0, 1, or 2. It validates","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427206080}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" PORT as an integer ","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427206134}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"matching 8000 plus the","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427206177}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" node ID. Missing or","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427206266}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" invalid values cause","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427206314}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" immediate exit.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427206362}
