{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" binding errors and ","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211029}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"prints a startup message","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211116}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" once listening begins.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211150}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" The supervisor script","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211233}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" will track PIDs, respawn","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211274}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" failed processes, and","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211359}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" prefix child logs with","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211403}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" identifiers such as","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211487}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" `[redis]` and `[node-0]`.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427211529}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"\n\nThe supervisor script","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427213660}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" will use process substitution","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427213748}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" (`> >(prefix_logs '[redis]'))","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427213826}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" instead of a pipe. ","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427213906}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"This lets `$!` capture","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427213945}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" the actual redis-server","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427214028}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" PID for respawn tracking.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427214129}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"\n\nThe supervisor script","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427215544}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" will prefix each child’s","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427215562}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" stdout and stderr with","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427215642}
