{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" issues.","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427215823}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"\n\nA pipe with sed would","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427219512}
{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":" capture sed’s PID instead","session_id":"e934a01f-2dbe-4734-a64e-e67918dbca20","timestamp_ms":1787427219564}
