ns, pins, files, search, groups, slash commands, mentions, read state, settings, SPA with pinned testids, WebSocket dense seq, and IRC bridging. No remote services, no Slack SDK, no Docker-in-Docker.\",\n  \"dependents\": [\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-10\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"DMs: get-or-create pairwise channel\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:08.808998976Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-11\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Files: upload, metadata, download, attach to messages\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:08.871230869Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-12\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Search across accessible channels\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:16.60312666Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-13\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Slash commands: me, shrug, topic, invite, archive\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:16.626578687Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-14\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Mentions resolution including group channel here\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"pri